  "methods": [],
  "body": "[crush~] is a bit-crusher/reducer and decimator abstraction based on the objects [quantizer~] (mode 4) and [downsample~], where an input signal quantized and downsampled to generate distortion and aliasing. The parameters vary from 0 to 1, where 0 is the original sound and the higher the parameter is, the more crushing/decimation we have."
